# Instagram

Stage 1 loads `@efemer_flowers` and `@himmlhaus` into **`ingest_items`** (idempotent on `account:shortcode`). Then `KeywordIngest` → `MaterializePosts` (see `ingest.mdc`). Soft `kind` and invitations come from Gemini, not PHP heuristics.

**Production primary path is Instaloader** — not the private archive API (`RefreshInstagram*`). Cron twice daily (`0 6,18 * * *` UTC → `deploy/cron-instagram-incremental.sh`): Instaloader dump → `ImportInstagramDump` → `KeywordIngest` → `MaterializePosts`. Log: `~/efemer2/logs/cron-instagram.log`. Docker `instagram-archive` loop stays **off**.

## Run (Instaloader)

Local venv: `tmp/instagram-venv` (dev) or production `.venv-instagram` (cron bootstraps it; needs host `python3-venv`).

```bash
cd ~/Sites/efemer
mkdir -p data/instagram
# --fast-update stops at the first already-downloaded post
# --count caps newest posts (safe when the dump dir is empty)
tmp/instagram-venv/bin/instaloader \
  --no-videos \
  --fast-update \
  --count 20 \
  --dirname-pattern 'data/instagram/{profile}' \
  --filename-pattern '{date_utc}_UTC' \
  efemer_flowers himmlhaus

./bin/job jobs:run App.Classes.Jobs.Ingest.ImportInstagramDump -f
./bin/job jobs:run App.Classes.Jobs.Ingest.KeywordIngest -f
./bin/job jobs:run App.Classes.Jobs.Ingest.MaterializePosts -f
```

Production one-shot (same as cron):

```bash
cd ~/efemer2 && ./deploy/cron-instagram-incremental.sh
```

Omit `--fast-update` only for a deliberate full re-dump. Anonymous scrape is enough for these public profiles.

## Legacy archive API (avoid)

`RefreshInstagram` / `RefreshInstagramAccounts` use the private archive API + Secret Manager `instagram-session-id`. They 429 easily — **do not use for routine ingest**. Prefer Instaloader above.

If you ever need the session secret again:

```bash
printf '%s' "$SESSIONID" | gcloud secrets versions add instagram-session-id \
  --project=efemer-456414 --account=jablunka@gmail.com --data-file=-
```
